msgstr "Nke a bụ ebe, na seva weebụ ebe a ga-echekwa RRDfiles na faịlụ PNG na cache. Poller ga-elekọta cache a. Hụ na ị nwere ikike ịgụ na ide ziri ezi na folda a"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Nke a bụ oge kacha nta a na-akwado n'etiti mmelite Eserese. A na-ejikwa ọnụọgụgụ a tọọ ụfọdụ àgwà RRDfile. Ọ bụrụ na ị nwere Ngwaọrụ na-echekwa data na cache ma ọ naghị enye mmelite realtime, ị nwere ike ịba ụba Oge Umeghari Kacha Nta ndabere iji gbochie imepụta Eserese nwere oghere."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Nke a bụ ụzọ gaa na sendmail na seva gị. (A na-eji ya naanị ma ọ bụrụ na ahọpụtara Sendmail dịka Ọrụ Ozi)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This option will rotate the Kadupul Log periodically."
msgstr "Nhọrọ a ga-agbagharị Ndekọ Kadupul kwa oge."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Nke a na-ezo aka n'àgwà kpọmkwem dị n'ime ndekọ LDAP nke ji aha ndị ọrụ nke ndị otu. Ọ dị mkpa ijide n'aka na ọnụọgụgụ àgwà ahụ kwekọrọ na nhazi akọwapụtara na \"Distinguished Name\" ma ọ bụ na a ga-achọta ezigbo ọnụọgụgụ àgwà ahụ site na iji ntọala akọwapụtara na \"Distinguished Name\"."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Ntọala a bụ maka sistemụ otu poller naanị iji wughachi tebụl mmepụta poller n'oge polling ọ bụla iji gbochie tebụl ebe nchekwa ịgbanwe swap na sistemụ buru ibu nke nwere nnukwu databases nwere ike iji swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This timespan you wish to see on the default graph."
msgstr "Ogologo oge a ị chọrọ ịhụ na eserese ndabere."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ a na-anọchite anya ọnụọgụ spikes kachasị ị ga-ewepụ na RRA Eserese."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ a na-anọchite anya ọnụọgụ ihe nlele nkezi dị elu na nke dị ala a ga-ewepụ na setịpụ ihe nlele tupu agbakọọ Nkezi Variance. Ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ ọnụọgụgụ outlier nke 5, mgbe ahụ a ga-ewepụ ma nkezi 5 kachasị elu ma nke kachasị ala."

