#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Cache Ajụjụ Data na-echekwa ozi anakọtara site na ụdị ntinye Ajụjụ Data. Enwere ike iji ọnụọgụgụ sitere na ogige ndị a na mpaghara ederede nke Eserese maka Nkọwa (Legends), Akara Kwụ Ọtọ (Vertical Labels), na GPRINTS yana na CDEFs."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Kadupul Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Ndekọ Kadupul na-echekwa ọnụọgụgụ, njehie na ozi ndị ọzọ dabere na ntọala sistemụ. Enwere ike iji ozi a chọpụta nsogbu na poller na ngwa."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "A ga-emegharị Cache Poller ma ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ nhọrọ a. Jiri nhọrọ a naanị ma ọ bụrụ na database daa ma ị na-enwe nsogbu mgbe ọdịda ahụ gasịrị ma gbaalarị ngwaọrụ ndozi database. N'aka nke ọzọ, ọ bụrụ na ị na-enwe nsogbu na Ngwaọrụ kpọmkwem, chekwaa Ngwaọrụ ahụ ọzọ iji wughachi Cache Poller ya. Enwekwara nhata interface ahịrị iwu (CLI) nke iwu a nke a tụrụ aro maka sistemụ buru ibu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The SNMP cache will be cleared and re-generated if you select this option. Note that it takes another poller run to restore the SNMP cache completely."
msgstr "A ga-ekpochapụ cache SNMP ma megharịa ya ma ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ nhọrọ a. Rịba ama na ọ na-ewe ọsọ poller ọzọ iji weghachite cache SNMP kpamkpam."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The minimum required can vary greatly if there is heavy user Graph viewing activity."
msgstr "Nke kacha nta achọrọ nwere ike ịdị iche nke ukwuu ma ọ bụrụ na enwere oke ọrụ nlele Eserese nke ndị ọrụ."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Nke a bụ data a na-ebufe na poller oge ọ bụla ọ na-agba. A na-eme/atụgharị data a ma nye nsonaazụ ya n'ime RRDfiles maka eserese ma ọ bụ database maka ngosi."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view the latest events SNMP Agent has handled in relation to the registered notification receivers."
msgstr "Nhọrọ menu a na-enye gị ohere ilele ihe omume kachasị ọhụrụ SNMP Agent jikọtara n'ihe gbasara ndị nnata ọkwa e debanyere aha."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view various boost settings and statistics associated with the current running Boost configuration."
msgstr "Nhọrọ menu a na-enye gị ohere ilele ntọala boost dị iche iche na ọnụọgụgụ metụtara nhazi Boost na-agba ugbu a."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This menu pick will purge all existing Data Source Statistics from the Database.  If Data Source Statistics is enabled, the Data Sources Statistics will start collection again on the next Data Collector pass."
msgstr "Nhọrọ menu a ga-ekpochapụ Ọnụọgụgụ Isi Iyi Data niile dị adị na Database. Ọ bụrụ na agbanwuola Ọnụọgụgụ Isi Iyi Data, Ọnụọgụgụ Isi Iyi Data ga-amalite nchịkọta ọzọ na ngafe Onye Nchịkọta Data na-esote."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This shows all objects being handled by the SNMP Agent."
msgstr "Nke a na-egosi ihe niile SNMP Agent na-elekọta."

#: utilities.php
msgid "This suggested memory value is calculated based on the number of data source present and is only to be used as a suggestion, actual values may vary system to system based on requirements."
msgstr "A gbakọrọ ọnụọgụgụ ebe nchekwa a tụrụ aro dabere na ọnụọgụ isi iyi data dị ugbu a ma a ga-eji ya naanị dịka aro, ezigbo ọnụọgụgụ nwere ike ịdị iche site na sistemụ ruo sistemụ dabere na ihe achọrọ."

