#: utilities.php
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Kadupul, Kadupul will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Kadupul will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Mgbe ị na-arụ ọrụ ọtụtụ Ndị Nchịkọta Data na Kadupul, Kadupul ga-anwa idobe ọnọdụ maka faịlụ dị mkpa na Ndị Nchịkọta Data niile. Nke a gụnyere faịlụ weebụsaịtị na plugin niile dị mkpa, ndị na-abụghị nke ntinye. Mgbe ị manyere iwughachi Cache Akụrụngwa, Kadupul ga-ekpochapụ Cache Akụrụngwa mpaghara, wee wughachi ya na mmalite poller a haziri ahazi na-esote. Nke a ga-akpali Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya niile ka ha lelee faịlụ weebụsaịtị na plugin ha ọzọ maka nkwekọ."

